      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for packers and movers delhi to coimbatore</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Moving your household or vehicle from Delhi to Coimbatore (or vice‑versa) is not just a logistical exercise – it is a regulated process that requires a suite of statutory transit paperwork and robust risk coverage.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>At the heart of this compliance are the GST e‑Way bill, the IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty), and a 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance issued by IRDAI.</span></li></ul>

<p>The GST e‑Way bill is generated online before the goods leave Delhi. It captures the value, description and destination of every item, allowing customs and state authorities to track the movement in real time.</p>
<p>For a relocation coimbatore to delhi or a car shifting from Mu Bai to Coimbatore, the e‑Way ensures that the transport vehicle is exempt from road‑tax and toll charges while the goods are in transit.</p>

<p>Once the vehicle departs, the IBA‑approved LR/Bilty is issued by the carrier. This document records the consignor, consignee, freight details and the agreed freight rate.</p>
<p>It serves as a proof of receipt for the goods and protects both parties in case of loss or damage. Movers in Delhi, such as de maria packers and movers delhi, often issue their own LR/Biltys in compliance with IBA standards, which are accepted by all major transport hubs along the Delhi–Coimbatore corridor.</p>

